{"id":"wb-5-308","name":"绮园","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"绮园","text":"绮园俗称冯家花园，为位于中国浙江省嘉兴市海盐县武原街道海滨东路44号（原城内混堂弄口）的一座中式古典园林，东西分别邻新桥北路和绮园路，南临海滨东路及市河，北临文昌东路。该园采用以自然山水景色为主的造园手法，既吸取了苏州、扬州园林的长处，又具有浙江地方特色，现为浙江保存最好、规模最大的私家园林，园林学家陈从周认为绮园“水随山转、山因水活”，赞誉“此园浙中数第一”。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%BB%AE%E5%9B%AD","revisionId":94309590,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94309590","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/76215557a9e279ca95ea4109.jpg","title":"Qi_Garden,_Haiyan,_2021-06-12_18.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Qi_Garden,_Haiyan,_2021-06-12_18.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/95/Qi_Garden%2C_Haiyan%2C_2021-06-12_18.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​海盐 绮园","width":320,"height":214}}